WEBVTT

00:00:18.240 --> 00:00:21.640
Genma, seventeen years...

00:00:21.640 --> 00:00:25.970
I will now settle our score from
seventeen years ago!

00:00:47.200 --> 00:00:49.290
Time to die!

00:00:51.640 --> 00:00:54.510
The perfect world!

00:00:54.510 --> 00:01:01.910
Tsukiakari no shita de yakusoku wo kawashita

00:01:01.910 --> 00:01:04.620
Let's break the spine!
Tsukiakari no shita de yakusoku wo kawashita

00:01:04.620 --> 00:01:09.390
Tsukiakari no shita de yakusoku wo kawashita

00:01:09.390 --> 00:01:13.720
Gozen reiji hoeru you ni sasayaite

00:01:14.260 --> 00:01:18.960
Chinmoku to zattou no naka

00:01:19.700 --> 00:01:24.030
Kuruisou de kowaresou na genjou kai

00:01:24.840 --> 00:01:28.770
Kimi wa sou sa kimi no mama ikite

00:01:28.770 --> 00:01:32.180
That perfect world!
Kimi wa sou sa kimi no mama ikite

00:01:32.680 --> 00:01:37.880
Kamereon janakute

00:01:37.880 --> 00:01:43.020
Kokoro kara kawarou

00:01:43.020 --> 00:01:46.730
Kikoeru yo sono kotoba

00:01:46.730 --> 00:01:53.270
Subete no yoru ga akeru you ni sakebou

00:01:53.270 --> 00:01:56.970
Hageshisa to yasashisa de

00:01:56.970 --> 00:02:08.470
Subete no yoru ga sakeru you ni sakebou

00:02:18.990 --> 00:02:21.360
Houraiji, don't let your guard down! He's...

00:02:21.360 --> 00:02:23.730
Yeah, I know it.

00:02:23.730 --> 00:02:25.160
Leave him to me.

00:02:25.160 --> 00:02:28.060
Oh? What is it you're saying you "know"?

00:02:38.840 --> 00:02:39.810
The Fou rth Night

00:02:40.310 --> 00:02:41.280
Martial Fist Chapter

00:02:43.010 --> 00:02:44.410
The Fist Does Not Take Lives

00:02:54.090 --> 00:02:56.220
D..Daigo?

00:02:59.160 --> 00:03:00.400
There's more coming!

00:03:00.400 --> 00:03:03.030
Gimme a break! They keep on coming,
no matter how many we cut down!

00:03:03.500 --> 00:03:05.140
Jeez, there's no end to 'em!

00:03:05.140 --> 00:03:06.410
You've got that right.

00:03:06.410 --> 00:03:08.840
We'll be overrun at this rate.

00:03:16.250 --> 00:03:18.720
What's this feeling?

00:03:37.400 --> 00:03:39.300
Things are getting pretty bad, huh?

00:03:40.270 --> 00:03:42.800
Ordinary people don't notice them.

00:03:43.280 --> 00:03:46.730
This is no doubt the result of some mystic rite.

00:03:51.720 --> 00:03:53.010
You!

00:03:54.390 --> 00:03:56.180
What's going on here?

00:03:56.960 --> 00:04:00.730
The last time we fought, his whole body
radiated his thirst for blood,

00:04:00.730 --> 00:04:03.560
and I could read his moves like
the palm of my hand.

00:04:05.630 --> 00:04:08.690
But now...

00:04:10.600 --> 00:04:12.260
No matter what stance I take...

00:04:13.670 --> 00:04:14.670
Oh, crap...

00:04:14.670 --> 00:04:15.970
Doshin!

00:04:19.980 --> 00:04:22.450
What, did you slip a disc, grandpa?

00:04:22.450 --> 00:04:24.780
Can it, ya brat!

00:04:54.880 --> 00:04:59.650
I almost did something inelegant.

00:05:01.620 --> 00:05:05.060
I am not fool enough to participate
in a fight that I cannot win.

00:05:07.930 --> 00:05:10.130
You beat me.

00:05:10.130 --> 00:05:11.760
Do as you will.

00:05:14.330 --> 00:05:17.130
In that case, how about we put you to work?

00:05:17.640 --> 00:05:19.100
Take the mystic square formation!

00:05:19.100 --> 00:05:21.100
We'll finish them in one fell swoop!

00:05:37.060 --> 00:05:39.620
Rin! Po! Tou!

00:05:49.300 --> 00:05:51.670
The evil ones have been obliterated.

00:05:51.670 --> 00:05:54.140
Looks like we cleaned them up all nice and tidy.

00:05:54.140 --> 00:05:56.270
That was a pretty kickin' jam session.

00:06:06.750 --> 00:06:09.650
Why does he look at me like that?

00:06:10.960 --> 00:06:12.580
Gr..Grandpa!

00:06:14.330 --> 00:06:16.060
Why you!

00:06:21.800 --> 00:06:23.100
Master!
Doshin!

00:06:24.000 --> 00:06:25.900
Hang in there, grandpa!

00:06:25.900 --> 00:06:26.940
Master Doshin!

00:06:26.940 --> 00:06:30.010
Hey, c'mon now, be quiet.

00:06:30.010 --> 00:06:31.910
I ain't done in yet.

00:06:31.910 --> 00:06:34.580
You don't got time to be worrying about me.

00:06:34.580 --> 00:06:37.020
Grandpa, I'm sorry, I was...

00:06:37.020 --> 00:06:39.680
Look at you actin' all out of character.

00:06:39.680 --> 00:06:42.650
You just make sure you work hard
to pay me back, Lightning Boy.

00:06:43.520 --> 00:06:44.650
You got it.

00:06:47.030 --> 00:06:48.820
It's gotten quiet.

00:06:51.600 --> 00:06:52.960
Hiyu...

00:06:52.960 --> 00:06:54.400
You go on ahead, Aoi.

00:06:54.400 --> 00:06:55.830
But...

00:06:55.830 --> 00:06:57.670
It's all right.

00:06:57.670 --> 00:06:59.300
Okay!

00:07:00.070 --> 00:07:02.140
I... I'm sorry.

00:07:02.140 --> 00:07:04.110
Daigo?

00:07:04.110 --> 00:07:09.250
I... I remember... all of it.

00:07:09.250 --> 00:07:14.950
That wasn't a dream at all, was it?

00:07:27.400 --> 00:07:28.870
Welcome back.

00:07:30.800 --> 00:07:32.500
Just kidding!

00:07:37.410 --> 00:07:40.010
C'mon, let's get over there too.

00:07:40.010 --> 00:07:41.740
Right!

00:07:42.610 --> 00:07:44.120
Why?

00:07:44.120 --> 00:07:47.820
Why are you so determined to fight me?

00:07:47.820 --> 00:07:50.120
Because I am under his orders.

00:07:50.120 --> 00:07:52.280
What the Director says goes.

00:07:53.260 --> 00:07:54.930
Do you mean...

00:07:54.930 --> 00:07:58.260
The Director has identified all
of you as evil ones.

00:07:58.260 --> 00:07:59.530
Which means I will...

00:07:59.530 --> 00:08:03.130
Nobody has the right to take another's life!

00:08:03.130 --> 00:08:06.300
You're... Aoi Misato?

00:08:06.300 --> 00:08:08.040
Misato?

00:08:08.040 --> 00:08:10.310
I don't care who's orders you're under,

00:08:10.310 --> 00:08:13.570
I will not allow you to kill an innocent person!

00:08:15.350 --> 00:08:19.040
It... It's not as though the Martial Fist
murders people indiscriminately!

00:08:19.650 --> 00:08:22.590
We assassinate only the most vile people,

00:08:22.590 --> 00:08:26.260
who act beyond the eye of the law,
committing evil deeds!

00:08:26.260 --> 00:08:28.660
Justice is on our side!

00:08:28.660 --> 00:08:31.320
You are blind; you see nothing.

00:08:33.330 --> 00:08:37.300
Even those who have committed
misdeeds for whatever reason

00:08:37.300 --> 00:08:40.470
should always be given a chance
to reform themselves!

00:08:40.470 --> 00:08:42.310
We have seen many people

00:08:42.310 --> 00:08:47.440
who fell victim to their own desires or dark sides
and turned into demons.

00:08:48.910 --> 00:08:51.880
But even those people...

00:08:51.880 --> 00:08:55.550
even they are redeemable given
some sort of chance!

00:08:56.860 --> 00:09:01.820
There are actually people who are doing their
utmost to fight their darker selves!

00:09:03.160 --> 00:09:04.890
So...

00:09:05.630 --> 00:09:08.100
That's why casting judgment upon people

00:09:08.100 --> 00:09:11.300
and denying them the infinite possibilities
of life is unforgivable!

00:09:12.440 --> 00:09:13.440
Be quiet!

00:09:13.440 --> 00:09:14.800
I will not!

00:09:15.540 --> 00:09:18.710
What you're saying is just pure idealism.

00:09:18.710 --> 00:09:22.010
Do you have any idea how many people
there are in the world

00:09:22.010 --> 00:09:25.010
who live without restraint, committing evil
deeds, preying upon the good?

00:09:26.220 --> 00:09:30.960
Do you understand how those who are betrayed
by the ones they believe in,

00:09:30.960 --> 00:09:32.680
or who have had their lives trampled, feel?

00:09:33.660 --> 00:09:37.260
Or how about those who are suffering and
are denied even the peace of death,

00:09:37.260 --> 00:09:40.160
who can't even speak their minds?

00:09:41.200 --> 00:09:45.160
But we are not the evil people you say we are!

00:09:47.070 --> 00:09:51.510
Every one of us is fighting desperately
to protect somebody's life!

00:09:54.750 --> 00:09:56.940
So, what are you saying then?

00:09:57.120 --> 00:10:00.450
I eliminate the evil per the Director's orders.

00:10:00.450 --> 00:10:05.010
That's all... That is all I do.

00:10:07.790 --> 00:10:09.160
All right then.

00:10:13.000 --> 00:10:15.560
Then strike me down with that fist!

00:10:16.600 --> 00:10:18.070
Oh, my!

00:10:18.070 --> 00:10:19.800
For cryin' out loud, that moron...

00:10:19.800 --> 00:10:23.330
But stop taking other people's lives!

00:10:24.580 --> 00:10:29.240
I'm sure the people you care about
wouldn't want you doing this either!

00:10:31.880 --> 00:10:33.540
Why do you hesitate?

00:10:36.020 --> 00:10:39.460
Don't lose your focus, Kureha.

00:10:39.460 --> 00:10:42.860
They are evil and we must eliminate them.

00:10:42.860 --> 00:10:44.230
Director!

00:10:44.230 --> 00:10:45.920
Master Narutaki!

00:10:50.240 --> 00:10:52.640
Master Narutaki, why?

00:10:53.500 --> 00:10:55.470
"Master"?

00:10:55.470 --> 00:10:56.940
It couldn't be.

00:10:56.940 --> 00:10:57.940
It's him!

00:10:57.940 --> 00:11:01.250
Yeah, that's what it looks like.

00:11:01.250 --> 00:11:04.620
Tatsuma... Hear me, Tatsuma:

00:11:04.620 --> 00:11:07.740
I am the one who gave the order to kill you.

00:11:08.690 --> 00:11:12.290
I am the director of the Martial Fist.

00:11:12.290 --> 00:11:14.850
No way, you're...

00:11:15.660 --> 00:11:18.290
That can't be, no way...

00:11:20.160 --> 00:11:21.460
No way!

00:11:22.700 --> 00:11:24.000
What is this?

00:11:24.000 --> 00:11:25.900
Director, what are you...

00:11:25.900 --> 00:11:28.110
Damn! He's already...

00:11:28.110 --> 00:11:30.810
The curse of dream negation?

00:11:30.810 --> 00:11:35.980
Arachi wo nokaruya no saki ni tatsu Shikamo

00:11:35.980 --> 00:11:41.680
Chigae wo sureba chigau tozokiku

00:11:49.530 --> 00:11:51.330
This is... Did he ensnare us?

00:11:51.330 --> 00:11:53.660
How could we have been swallowed up already?

00:11:59.540 --> 00:12:00.970
Genma?

00:12:00.970 --> 00:12:02.460
Genma, is that you?!

00:12:07.110 --> 00:12:08.110
Where am l?

00:12:08.110 --> 00:12:10.270
Take this!

00:12:12.980 --> 00:12:14.280
Big sister?!

00:12:14.590 --> 00:12:16.020
To hell with this "big sister" crap!

00:12:16.020 --> 00:12:18.720
I'm so sick of your little goodie-two-shoes act!

00:12:19.660 --> 00:12:22.090
Just the site of your little honor student
face makes me wanna puke!

00:12:22.090 --> 00:12:24.660
I'm gonna chop you up into pig slop!

00:12:24.660 --> 00:12:28.170
You crude, worthless, ill-tempered fuckin' bitch!

00:12:28.170 --> 00:12:30.000
You're a disgrace to the Oribe family!

00:12:30.000 --> 00:12:31.800
St..Stop it, Hina.

00:12:31.800 --> 00:12:33.930
Stop it!

00:12:39.540 --> 00:12:40.840
Ryouichi...

00:12:53.520 --> 00:12:56.460
Director, he's...

00:12:56.460 --> 00:12:58.100
This Hiyu Tatsuma is...

00:12:58.100 --> 00:13:03.230
That's right, Kureha, he's your fellow disciple.

00:13:03.970 --> 00:13:06.240
But you needn't harbor any doubts.

00:13:06.240 --> 00:13:07.510
B..But...

00:13:07.510 --> 00:13:10.800
Have you forgotten about your mother?

00:13:15.780 --> 00:13:19.720
Damn, your jerk of a boss is a
real piece of work, man!

00:13:19.920 --> 00:13:21.850
His approach is indeed... unusual.

00:13:21.850 --> 00:13:22.990
What the...

00:13:22.990 --> 00:13:24.510
What the heck is this?!

00:13:28.790 --> 00:13:30.260
Kisaragi!

00:13:30.260 --> 00:13:32.060
This is a mystic Onmyo spell.

00:13:32.060 --> 00:13:33.660
We don't have the strength to fight it.

00:13:36.500 --> 00:13:38.770
So, what's the deal with your boss?

00:13:38.770 --> 00:13:42.070
Is he being manipulated by someone, or...

00:13:42.070 --> 00:13:44.230
Guess this means we'll have to ask him directly.

00:13:45.410 --> 00:13:47.880
Okay, then...

00:13:48.480 --> 00:13:49.780
Let's do it!

00:13:49.980 --> 00:13:51.320
What the!

00:13:51.320 --> 00:13:52.940
Th..This is bad!

00:14:02.360 --> 00:14:03.730
Grandfather?!

00:14:03.730 --> 00:14:06.660
S..So, you've returned?

00:14:07.430 --> 00:14:09.730
Um, l...

00:14:11.270 --> 00:14:14.330
I was unable to complete my mission.

00:14:18.110 --> 00:14:19.410
Grandfather?

00:14:20.240 --> 00:14:21.550
Kisaragi!

00:14:21.550 --> 00:14:23.050
Kisaragi, snap out of it!

00:14:23.050 --> 00:14:24.340
Grandfather...

00:14:25.280 --> 00:14:26.580
Kisaragi!

00:14:27.390 --> 00:14:29.150
Get a grip, Aoi!

00:14:29.150 --> 00:14:31.190
But Kisaragi's been...

00:14:31.190 --> 00:14:33.360
You are a handful, aren't you?

00:14:33.360 --> 00:14:35.460
You? Why did you...

00:14:35.460 --> 00:14:37.990
I am a friend of all who are beautiful.

00:14:54.110 --> 00:14:57.740
What's the matter? Still unsure?

00:14:58.880 --> 00:15:01.990
Very well then, you leave me no choice.

00:15:01.990 --> 00:15:05.180
I will now tell you the truth.

00:15:06.860 --> 00:15:10.330
This weapon is the treasured vajra pestle
of the Urakouya exorcists.

00:15:10.330 --> 00:15:11.600
I am now going to use its power

00:15:11.600 --> 00:15:14.830
to provide them with support from afar
through the use of a fire dharani.

00:15:14.830 --> 00:15:17.370
I will test the enemy's spiritual field.

00:15:17.370 --> 00:15:19.200
It's about 500 yojana away.

00:15:19.200 --> 00:15:22.710
If my focus is disrupted,
it could endanger our own lives.

00:15:22.710 --> 00:15:24.040
Give this your utmost conentration.

00:15:24.040 --> 00:15:25.380
Okay!
Are you serious?

00:15:25.380 --> 00:15:28.780
Tatsuma, the fighting art I taught you is

00:15:28.780 --> 00:15:31.540
an art of assassination!

00:15:33.550 --> 00:15:35.690
Nomaku Saraba Tatagyateibyaku

00:15:35.690 --> 00:15:36.890
Saraba Bokkeibyaku

00:15:36.890 --> 00:15:39.160
Sarabada Tarata Senda Makaroshada

00:15:39.160 --> 00:15:40.160
Ken Gyakigyaki

00:15:40.160 --> 00:15:42.490
Saraba Bikin'nan Untarata Kanman!

00:15:43.260 --> 00:15:44.730
Art of assassination?

00:15:45.730 --> 00:15:48.760
That's right, it is an art of assassination.

00:15:51.000 --> 00:15:52.570
Seventeen years ago,

00:15:52.570 --> 00:15:59.270
Ryuzan, Doshin and I fought together
against a common enemy.

00:16:01.650 --> 00:16:02.650
Stop!

00:16:02.650 --> 00:16:04.270
Don't listen, Tatsuma!

00:16:06.380 --> 00:16:09.420
He was a strong and fearsome opponent.

00:16:09.420 --> 00:16:14.590
But we defeated him and were successful
in sealing him away.

00:16:15.030 --> 00:16:18.000
And why were we were able to do this?

00:16:26.440 --> 00:16:29.270
Because we allowed our comrade to die.

00:16:32.240 --> 00:16:38.740
Yes, we survived by sacrificing the
life of our own comrade.

00:16:38.850 --> 00:16:41.550
Out of fear for our own lives, you see.

00:16:45.390 --> 00:16:49.530
And that man we allowed to die...

00:16:49.530 --> 00:16:51.430
Don't do it!

00:16:52.700 --> 00:16:56.830
...was Genma Hiyu, your father.

00:17:02.970 --> 00:17:05.580
No... It can't be...

00:17:05.580 --> 00:17:12.650
That is, Ryuzan, Doshin and I killed your father!

00:17:12.650 --> 00:17:15.180
No, way... That's a lie!

00:17:16.420 --> 00:17:18.090
Served him right!

00:17:18.090 --> 00:17:20.790
He was a master of the assassin's arts,

00:17:20.790 --> 00:17:24.060
a brute who murdered countless people!

00:17:24.800 --> 00:17:27.260
It's only natural he got his just desserts that way.

00:17:27.900 --> 00:17:29.330
It's a lie...

00:17:29.670 --> 00:17:31.240
A LlE!

00:17:31.240 --> 00:17:33.440
Nomaku Saraba Tatagyateibyaku

00:17:33.440 --> 00:17:34.770
Saraba Bokkeibyaku

00:17:34.770 --> 00:17:35.270
Sarabada Tarata Senda Makaroshada

00:17:35.270 --> 00:17:37.240
You kids hang on.
Sarabada Tarata Senda Makaroshada

00:17:37.240 --> 00:17:38.300
You kids hang on.
Ken Gyakigyaki

00:17:38.910 --> 00:17:42.710
You know why I sent you to Magami?

00:17:42.710 --> 00:17:43.950
Do ya?

00:17:43.950 --> 00:17:45.980
Do not be deceived, Tatsuma!

00:17:45.980 --> 00:17:49.080
He's spouting a bunch of shit!
Don't listen to him!

00:17:50.150 --> 00:17:53.860
It was to have you kill the ones
with the Stars of Fate

00:17:53.860 --> 00:17:57.320
with the same killing arts that Genma used!

00:17:58.660 --> 00:18:01.000
They're a curse on this world,

00:18:01.000 --> 00:18:04.000
Iike a bunch of filthy beasts!

00:18:04.000 --> 00:18:06.700
See, I meant to have you finish 'em all off,

00:18:06.700 --> 00:18:09.370
since all you're good for is killing!

00:18:09.670 --> 00:18:10.910
And what happens?

00:18:10.910 --> 00:18:14.350
You get all buddy-buddy with these fuckin' beasts,
and start acting like you're their friend!

00:18:14.350 --> 00:18:17.140
Seriously, could you have been
any more of a dud?

00:18:17.420 --> 00:18:21.610
So, that's why I tried to have you taken out,
along with the rest of 'em!

00:18:22.420 --> 00:18:23.620
Tatsuma!

00:18:23.620 --> 00:18:25.850
You piece of shit...

00:18:26.520 --> 00:18:27.990
No way...

00:18:27.990 --> 00:18:30.360
It's a lie...

00:18:32.100 --> 00:18:34.730
So now you understand, Kureha.

00:18:34.730 --> 00:18:36.470
Now, kill him.

00:18:36.470 --> 00:18:40.070
Kill this filthy swine.

00:18:40.070 --> 00:18:43.210
You can't let him live, can you?

00:18:43.210 --> 00:18:47.450
I mean, it's guys like this that
made your mom suffer!

00:18:47.450 --> 00:18:49.450
M..Mom...

00:18:49.450 --> 00:18:51.450
That's right, Kureha.

00:18:51.450 --> 00:18:54.290
Let that bitterness out now.

00:18:54.290 --> 00:18:56.910
Eradicate Tatsuma Hiyu!

00:18:59.090 --> 00:19:03.360
I'm sure the people you care about
wouldn't want you doing this either!

00:19:08.370 --> 00:19:09.660
I cannot do it.

00:19:10.270 --> 00:19:11.500
Is that Hiyu?

00:19:11.500 --> 00:19:12.870
I can hear them.

00:19:13.440 --> 00:19:16.300
Director, please explain to me...

00:19:17.270 --> 00:19:22.440
Why would such wicked people have
innocent eyes like theirs?

00:19:22.950 --> 00:19:23.950
Hina!

00:19:23.950 --> 00:19:24.920
Big sister?

00:19:26.950 --> 00:19:30.720
Oh boy, do I have some useless pupils.

00:19:30.720 --> 00:19:32.420
Ah, well.

00:19:37.330 --> 00:19:41.590
You should appreciate this, my worthless pupils!

00:19:42.100 --> 00:19:45.800
Your teacher will personally see to your demise!

00:19:51.710 --> 00:19:53.980
Tatsuma!
The crane and the turtle slipped

00:19:53.980 --> 00:19:58.520
The crane and the turtle slipped

00:19:58.520 --> 00:20:02.390
In the morning twilight

00:20:02.390 --> 00:20:06.380
Who is behind you?

00:20:06.790 --> 00:20:08.630
Snap out of it, Hiyu!

00:20:08.630 --> 00:20:09.630
Hiyu!

00:20:09.630 --> 00:20:13.360
Wake up, dammit! Tatsuma!

00:20:14.970 --> 00:20:16.930
Get up, Hiyu!

00:20:25.110 --> 00:20:27.240
Listen, Hiyu...

00:20:27.240 --> 00:20:31.080
All the things we've done have
not been wrong in any way.

00:20:31.080 --> 00:20:33.620
No one should understand that better...

00:20:33.620 --> 00:20:35.950
...than you, right?

00:20:35.950 --> 00:20:38.650
You're not any kind of "killer".

00:20:41.790 --> 00:20:44.060
You shall bide your time

00:20:44.060 --> 00:20:48.260
until the time comes for you
to put your skills to use.

00:20:52.400 --> 00:20:55.240
Do ya see the River Styx yet? Do ya?!

00:21:00.180 --> 00:21:02.210
Nomaku Saraba Tatagyateibyaku

00:21:02.210 --> 00:21:03.410
Saraba Bokkeibyaku

00:21:03.410 --> 00:21:05.650
Sarabada Tarata Senda Makaroshada

00:21:05.650 --> 00:21:06.980
Ken Gyakigyaki

00:21:08.250 --> 00:21:10.190
I'm surprised!

00:21:10.190 --> 00:21:13.820
You were able to escape my spell on your own.

00:21:13.820 --> 00:21:17.030
But well, is that all you got?

00:21:17.030 --> 00:21:19.390
Frankly, you lack the proper training.

00:21:20.630 --> 00:21:22.270
Well, now...

00:21:22.270 --> 00:21:27.030
Okay, you have a nice, long
sleep on the other si...

00:21:38.620 --> 00:21:39.780
You gotta be kidding.

00:21:39.780 --> 00:21:41.480
He was alive?

00:21:42.050 --> 00:21:43.550
What's going on?

00:21:43.550 --> 00:21:45.720
That man is the real...

00:21:45.720 --> 00:21:47.450
...Togo Narutaki?

00:21:48.060 --> 00:21:49.420
Director?

00:21:50.030 --> 00:21:52.520
Master, what in the world was that sensation?

00:21:53.230 --> 00:21:54.900
It looks like we were in time.

00:21:54.900 --> 00:21:56.390
We were?

00:21:59.570 --> 00:22:02.800
Some..someone... Someone come quick!

00:22:05.080 --> 00:22:09.640
He used a familiar to impersonate me.

00:22:13.720 --> 00:22:15.340
Master...
Director...

00:22:28.230 --> 00:22:30.720
Children of the Stars of Fate...

00:22:41.710 --> 00:22:46.820
Kanashige ni sukoshi utsumuite

00:22:46.820 --> 00:22:51.520
Yatto kimi wa tsubuyaita

00:22:51.920 --> 00:23:01.090
Kasuka ni kikoeta no wa seiippai no sayonara

00:23:03.030 --> 00:23:07.970
Fushizen na chinmoku no naka

00:23:07.970 --> 00:23:12.240
Hibiku bokura no kodou

00:23:12.240 --> 00:23:16.610
Mata aeru meguriaou yo

00:23:16.610 --> 00:23:22.420
Sorezore no asu wo sagashi ni deyou yo

00:23:22.420 --> 00:23:26.920
Setsunasa ni yasashisa kureta

00:23:26.920 --> 00:23:31.360
Ima kimi ni arigatou

00:23:32.530 --> 00:23:37.170
Marude sou kono hanabira ga

00:23:37.170 --> 00:23:42.810
Tabidachi wo shukufuku shiteru you sa

00:23:42.810 --> 00:23:47.180
Sabishisa wo tsutsunde kureta

00:23:47.180 --> 00:23:51.640
Nukumori wasurenai

00:23:52.450 --> 00:23:56.910
Ima kimi ni arigatou

00:24:06.500 --> 00:24:07.430
Next Episode

